{"v":1,"id":"e558b016cc3e","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"You will never know the stone cold grave,","s":34.28,"e":37.23},{"t":"nor hang from a criminal’s tree.","s":37.31,"e":42.8},{"t":"Never taste that severed breath","s":42.87,"e":45.61},{"t":"when heaven seemed far from Me.","s":45.69,"e":51.19},{"t":"You will never sweat out drops of blood","s":51.27,"e":54.39},{"t":"in a garden pressed alone.","s":54.47,"e":56.1},{"t":"Never hear brutes haggle your garments.","s":56.14,"e":62.99},{"t":"Hung bare, stripped down to bone.","s":63.05,"e":68.03},{"t":"As they pierced My side and lifted Me high,","s":68.11,"e":72.83},{"t":"arms opened wide between earth and sky…","s":72.93,"e":76.53},{"t":"I was brought down low in My passion.","s":76.65,"e":79.96},{"t":"I bore that hour to make you Mine.","s":80.08,"e":84.28},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":84.3,"e":86.41},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":86.51,"e":88.46},{"t":"Love does not turn away.","s":88.53,"e":92.79},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":92.9,"e":94.86},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":94.97,"e":96.95},{"t":"I bore the price that day.","s":97.07,"e":101.89},{"t":"I hope you never feel what I feel","s":101.91,"e":104.89},{"t":"when the earth is filled with violence.","s":104.93,"e":110.78},{"t":"When rivers of tears and blood run dry","s":110.84,"e":114.47},{"t":"and heaven answers silence.","s":114.57,"e":117.15},{"t":"My heart is very heavy.","s":117.21,"e":123.04},{"t":"I take no pleasure at all.","s":123.16,"e":127.26},{"t":"As My hand draws back in anger,","s":127.36,"e":130.92},{"t":"Tears continue to fall.","s":131.01,"e":136.25},{"t":"My blood runs down - and they refuse it.","s":136.33,"e":139.86},{"t":"My tears fall like rain - yet they turn away.","s":139.97,"e":144.16},{"t":"They heap up death with willing hands.","s":144.26,"e":148.26},{"t":"Still they choose it.","s":148.3,"e":151.36},{"t":"They choose death.","s":151.39,"e":172.7},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":172.73,"e":174.81},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":174.92,"e":176.88},{"t":"Love does not delight in flame.","s":176.97,"e":179.31},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":179.36,"e":183.27},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":183.38,"e":185.26},{"t":"Yet still I am the same.","s":185.36,"e":190.14},{"t":"As they bruise Me and spit in My face,","s":190.16,"e":194.44},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":194.55,"e":198.48},{"t":"As they pierce My side,","s":198.56,"e":201.13},{"t":"blood and tears run down together.","s":201.22,"e":206.9},{"t":"As My own people drive in the nails,","s":206.96,"e":210.25},{"t":"I am lifted from My place,","s":210.29,"e":215.73},{"t":"arms spread apart, waiting still","s":215.83,"e":219.23},{"t":"to receive them in embrace.","s":219.35,"e":223.42},{"t":"Oh My people… why?","s":223.51,"e":226.85},{"t":"why have you forsaken Me?","s":226.92,"e":231.75},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":231.83,"e":233.83},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":233.91,"e":236.0},{"t":"Forsake Me?","s":236.1,"e":241.91},{"t":"Me?","s":242.02,"e":243.98},{"t":"Why forsake Me?","s":244.08,"e":252.04},{"t":"Why forsake Me?","s":252.14,"e":257.08},{"t":"This sorrow will not rise again.","s":257.1,"e":260.81},{"t":"This ruin must not remain.","s":260.91,"e":265.44},{"t":"Love will purge what love must purge","s":265.53,"e":269.49},{"t":"Death can not reign.","s":269.59,"e":272.82},{"t":"I take no pleasure in what must be done ,","s":272.92,"e":277.51},{"t":"no pleasure at all.","s":277.61,"e":282.03},{"t":"Evil will not toil forever.","s":282.13,"e":284.73},{"t":"Our tears will cease to fall.","s":284.81,"e":293.36},{"t":"fall","s":293.46,"e":297.34},{"t":"fall","s":297.44,"e":301.73},{"t":"fall","s":301.83,"e":305.65},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":305.66,"e":307.58},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":307.68,"e":309.65},{"t":"But not for endless years.","s":309.75,"e":313.96},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":314.07,"e":316.11},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":316.22,"e":317.9},{"t":"Purging sorrows and fears.","s":317.96,"e":322.9},{"t":"I am come down.","s":322.91,"e":326.56},{"t":"Not divided in My heart.","s":326.66,"e":332.14},{"t":"Love that bled for you","s":332.24,"e":334.52},{"t":"now takes man's kingdoms apart.","s":334.6,"e":339.44},{"t":"I AM.","s":339.55,"e":347.56},{"t":"I AM.","s":347.68,"e":351.71},{"t":"I AM come down!","s":351.83,"e":354.0},{"t":"down","s":354.1,"e":354.86},{"t":"down","s":354.96,"e":359.73},{"t":"down","s":359.82,"e":360.29}],"match":null}
